<PageTitle>Empty — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Empty</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A list with nothing in it. Three things it needs and usually lacks: the reason, one obvious
    action, and a way out when it is empty because of a filter rather than because there is
    nothing.
</p>

